<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Cure Blind</h1>
<p>Sphere: Divine Sphere
Class: Healer (guild level 15), Druid (guild level 29)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast cure blind &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast cure blind</a>   (on yourself)
</pre>
<p>Lifts the blindness of the blind spell, so the target can see again. It is 
an easy spell: even a poor cast usually works.
</p><p>Being blind, you can't see the room or who is in it, and you can't use a 
wand. A healer friend, or a potion or scroll of cure blind, is the way out. 
You must be standing.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Blind</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Divine Sphere</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Healers</a>
</pre>




</div>